Scoped swaprect rectangle swap filter

The option table, per-frame expression variables, double-to-int conversion,
coordinate clamping, AV_CEIL_RSHIFT subsampling rounding, the per-plane
pw==aw/ph==ah swap condition, the in-place row swap (memcpy to a temporary,
memmove, memcpy back) and the pixel-step and plane-count derivation in
src/video-ops/swaprect.ts follow libavfilter/vf_swaprect.c (swaprect_options,
var_names, query_formats, filter_frame, config_input), and the format list
follows ff_formats_pixdesc_filter in libavfilter/formats.c with the
AV_PIX_FMT_FLAG_PAL, AV_PIX_FMT_FLAG_HWACCEL and AV_PIX_FMT_FLAG_BITSTREAM
rejections of query_formats.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
